function renderDashboardBudget(){const month=today().slice(0,7),plan=budgetFor(month),items=monthSpending(month),spent=sum(items),limit=plan.total,status=budgetStatus(limit?spent/limit:0);$('#dashboardBudgetStrip').innerHTML=`<div><span class="section-kicker">THIS MONTH'S PLAN</span><h3>本月預算 · ${month.replace('-',' / ')}</h3><p>${limit?`${money(spent)} / ${money(limit)} · <b class="budget-state ${status.className}">${status.label}</b>`:`本月支出 ${money(spent)} · 尚未設定總預算`}</p></div><div class="budget-dashboard-action">${limit?progressHtml(spent,limit):''}<button type="button" class="button button-soft" data-go="planner">查看預算 →</button></div>`;}
function renderPlanner(){if(!/^\d{4}-\d{2}$/.test(budgetMonth))budgetMonth=today().slice(0,7);$('#budgetMonth').value=budgetMonth;const plan=budgetFor(budgetMonth),items=monthSpending(budgetMonth),spent=sum(items),total=plan.total,ratio=total?spent/total:0,state=budgetStatus(ratio),remain=total-spent;
 $('#budgetCards').innerHTML=`<div class="planner-metric"><span>已記錄支出</span><strong>${money(spent)}</strong><small>${items.length} 筆支出</small></div><div class="planner-metric"><span>當月總預算</span><strong>${total?money(total):'尚未設定'}</strong><small>只作為提醒，不會自動扣款</small></div><div class="planner-metric"><span>${remain>=0?'預算剩餘':'已超支'}</span><strong class="${remain<0?'negative':''}">${total?money(Math.abs(remain)):'—'}</strong><small class="budget-state ${state.className}">${total?state.label:'可在下方設定'}</small></div>`;
 $('#budgetTotal').value=total||'';const names=Object.keys(cats).sort((a,b)=>a.localeCompare(b,'zh-Hant'));
 $('#budgetCategoryFields').innerHTML=names.map(cat=>`<label class="budget-category-input"><span>${esc(getCategory(cat).emoji)} ${esc(cat)}</span><input type="number" min="0" step="1" inputmode="numeric" data-budget-cat="${esc(cat)}" aria-label="${esc(cat)} 分類預算" placeholder="不設定" value="${plan.cats[cat]||''}"></label>`).join('');
 const map=Object.fromEntries(catTotals(items));const namesWithBudget=[...new Set([...Object.keys(map),...Object.keys(plan.cats)])].sort((a,b)=>(map[b]||0)-(map[a]||0));
 const configured=namesWithBudget.filter(name=>plan.cats[name]);$('#budgetStatusText').textContent=`${configured.length} 個分類已設定上限`;
 $('#budgetProgressList').innerHTML=namesWithBudget.length?namesWithBudget.map(cat=>{const v=map[cat]||0,limit=plan.cats[cat]||0,st=budgetStatus(limit?v/limit:0);return `<button type="button" class="budget-progress-row" data-budget-view-cat="${esc(cat)}"><span class="budget-row-head"><b>${esc(getCategory(cat).emoji)} ${esc(cat)}</b><span>${money(v)} <span class="muted">/ ${limit?money(limit):'未設定'}</span></span></span>${progressHtml(v,limit)}<span class="budget-row-foot"><small class="budget-state ${st.className}">${limit?st.label:'未設上限'}</small><small>${limit?`${(v/limit*100).toFixed(0)}%`:'查看明細 ↗'}</small></span></button>`;}).join(''):empty('這個月尚未有支出','記帳後將自動顯示分類預算進度。',false);
 renderRecurring();}
function nextOccurrenceForMonth(r,month){const [y,m]=month.split('-').map(Number),[sy,sm,sd]=r.start.split('-').map(Number),diff=(y-sy)*12+(m-sm);if(diff<0||diff%r.interval!==0)return null;const days=new Date(y,m,0).getDate();const due=`${month}-${String(Math.min(sd,days)).padStart(2,'0')}`;return due<r.start?null:due;}
function recurringOccurrences(){const set=[];const current=today().slice(0,7);for(const r of planner.recurring.filter(x=>x.active)){for(let i=-2;i<=1;i++){const month=addMonth(current+'-01',i).slice(0,7),due=nextOccurrenceForMonth(r,month);if(!due)continue;const key=`${r.id}|${due}`,posted=records.some(x=>x.recurringKey===key),skipped=r.skips.includes(due);if(!posted&&!skipped)set.push({...r,due,key,isFuture:due>today(),isOverdue:due<today()});}}return set.sort((a,b)=>a.due.localeCompare(b.due)||a.name.localeCompare(b.name));}
function renderRecurring(){const active=planner.recurring.filter(x=>x.active),due=recurringOccurrences(),overdue=due.filter(x=>x.isOverdue),todayDue=due.filter(x=>!x.isFuture);$('#recurringSummary').innerHTML=`<div><span>啟用中的固定項目</span><strong>${active.length}</strong></div><div><span>待確認期別</span><strong>${due.length}</strong></div><div><span>今天以前未入帳</span><strong class="${overdue.length?'negative':''}">${overdue.length}</strong></div>`;
 $('#recurringDue').innerHTML=due.length?due.map(r=>`<article class="recurring-due-card"><div class="due-date ${r.isOverdue?'overdue':''}"><b>${esc(r.due.slice(5))}</b><small>${r.isFuture?'即將到期':r.isOverdue?'尚未處理':'今日到期'}</small></div><div class="due-description"><strong>${esc(r.name)}</strong><p>${esc(getCategory(r.category).emoji)} ${esc(r.category)} · ${r.type==='income'?'收入':'支出'} · ${money(r.amount)}</p></div><div class="due-actions"><button type="button" class="button button-primary" data-recurring-post="${esc(r.key)}">確認入帳</button><button type="button" class="button button-outline" data-recurring-skip="${esc(r.key)}">略過本期</button></div></article>`).join(''):'<div class="recurring-empty">✦ 目前沒有待確認的固定收支。模板不會自動新增交易。</div>';
 $('#recurringTemplates').innerHTML=planner.recurring.length?planner.recurring.map(r=>`<article class="recurring-template ${r.active?'':'inactive'}"><div class="recurring-template-icon">${esc(getCategory(r.category).emoji)}</div><div class="recurring-template-info"><b>${esc(r.name)}</b><span>${esc(r.start)} 起 · ${({'1':'每月','2':'每兩個月','3':'每季','12':'每年'})[String(r.interval)]} · ${money(r.amount)} ${r.active?'':'· 已暫停'}</span></div><div class="template-actions"><button type="button" data-recurring-edit="${esc(r.id)}">編輯</button><button type="button" data-recurring-toggle="${esc(r.id)}">${r.active?'暫停':'啟用'}</button><button type="button" data-recurring-delete="${esc(r.id)}" class="text-danger">刪除</button></div></article>`).join(''):empty('尚未建立固定收支','新增例如房租、電費、保費或固定薪資，並在每期到期時確認入帳。',false);
}
function openRecurring(id){const r=planner.recurring.find(x=>x.id===id);$('#recurringForm').reset();$('#recurringId').value=r?.id||'';$('#recurringTitle').textContent=r?'編輯固定收支':'新增固定收支';$('#recurringType').value=r?.type||'expense';$('#recurringInterval').value=String(r?.interval||1);$('#recurringName').value=r?.name||'';$('#recurringAmount').value=r?.amount||'';$('#recurringStart').value=r?.start||today();$('#recurringMemo').value=r?.memo||'';$('#recurringCategory').innerHTML=Object.keys(cats).map(cat=>`<option value="${esc(cat)}">${esc(getCategory(cat).emoji)} ${esc(cat)}</option>`).join('');$('#recurringCategory').value=r?.category||'電費';showModal('recurringModal');}
async function recurringSave(e){e.preventDefault();const id=$('#recurringId').value||guid(),old=planner.recurring.find(r=>r.id===id);const obj=sanitizePlanner({recurring:[{id,name:$('#recurringName').value.trim(),type:$('#recurringType').value,interval:Number($('#recurringInterval').value),amount:Number($('#recurringAmount').value),category:$('#recurringCategory').value,start:$('#recurringStart').value,memo:$('#recurringMemo').value,active:old?.active??true,skips:old?.skips||[]}]}).recurring[0];if(!obj||!obj.name){toast('請確認項目、金額與首次日期');return;}try{if(old)Object.assign(old,obj);else planner.recurring.push(obj);await savePlanner();closeModal('recurringModal');renderPlanner();toast('固定收支已儲存 ✓');}catch(e){console.error(e);toast('固定收支儲存失敗');}}
function locateOcc(key){return recurringOccurrences().find(x=>x.key===key);}
function recurringPrefill(key){const r=locateOcc(key);if(!r)return toast('找不到該期別，可能已入帳或已略過');if(records.some(x=>x.recurringKey===key))return toast('此期別已經入帳');openModal();$('#entryRecurringKey').value=key;$('#entryDate').value=r.due;setEntryType(r.type);$('#entryAmount').value=r.amount;$('#entryCategory').value=r.category;$('#entryNote').value=r.name;$('#entryMemo').value=r.memo;$('#entryTitle').textContent='確認固定收支入帳';toast('已帶入資料，請確認金額、日期，再按儲存記帳');}
async function recurringSkip(key){const r=locateOcc(key);if(!r)return;const obj=planner.recurring.find(x=>x.id===r.id);if(!obj||!confirm(`略過 ${r.name} ${r.due} 這一期？不會新增支出，可以日後再編輯模板。`))return;obj.skips.push(r.due);await savePlanner();renderPlanner();toast('已略過此期固定收支');}
async function recurringAction(action,id){const obj=planner.recurring.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!obj)return;if(action==='edit')return openRecurring(id);if(action==='delete'){if(!confirm(`刪除固定收支模板「${obj.name}」？\n過去已入帳的記帳不會刪除。`))return;planner.recurring=planner.recurring.filter(x=>x.id!==id);}else obj.active=!obj.active;await savePlanner();renderPlanner();toast('固定收支已更新');}
